; English installer strings. Keep the keys in step with he-IL.nsh.
LangString FinishRun ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open Andruna"
LangString NeedsWindows11 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Andruna needs Windows 11. Update Windows, then run this installer again."
LangString NoBuildForThisPC ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer does not contain Andruna for this PC's processor. Download the installer for your PC from the Andruna website."
LangString RemoveDataQuestion ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also remove the Android apps you installed with Andruna, and their data?$\r$\n$\r$\nChoose No to keep them for when you install Andruna again."
